  nonce: fc79  # fc79
  message: "Merged in PR iterabloom/hypergumbo#2746 (commit 45895a45c). Added slice_access_mode_coverage field to RepoMetrics, computed from call edges in slice.0.json with access_mode set, and threaded through assess_metric. When slice-relative coverage >= 50%, LOW_DATAFLOW_SLICE_RATIO WARN is suppressed (treated as denominator-effect false alarm). Verified against deep-20260407-030917 artifacts: alertmanager 63.7%, kserve 38.5% (real signal preserved), prometheus 70.7% (clears the WARN). Three new tests in TestDataflowSliceRatioConditional cover the new logic."  # fc79
